><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                       ind4 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                  codepage </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">65001L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Names</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ind1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ind2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ind3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ind4&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  row</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">names </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;data.frame&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>This model </div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">    cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;latent =~ ind1 + ind2 + ind3 + ind4&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> foo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br>Works fine. But this, which I thought was equivalent<br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">    lavaan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;latent =~ ind1 + ind2 + ind3 + ind4&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>       data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> foo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>       model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;cfa&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br>causes an error:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><br>    Error in lav_model_estimate(lavmodel = lavmodel, lavsamplestats = lavsamplestats,  : <br>      lavaan ERROR: initial model-implied matrix (Sigma) is not positive definite;<br>      check your model and/or starting parameters.</blockquote><div><br></div><div>What am I missing?</div><div><br></div></div>"
